## Original Content
À l’exception de l’extrême gauche mélenchoniste, tous les candidats à l’élection présidentielle leur promettront sans doute un soutien sans faille jeudi devant les patrons.

## Summary
The editorial by Gaëtan de Capèle highlights that companies desire substantive support from politicians, not just slogans. It states that, with the exception of Mélenchon's far-left, all presidential candidates will likely promise unwavering support to business leaders at an upcoming meeting.

## Key Points
- Companies seek meaningful support from politicians beyond empty promises.
- Most presidential candidates are expected to pledge support to business leaders.
- Mélenchon's far-left is an exception in offering such support.
- The context involves a meeting with business leaders scheduled for Thursday.


